    question: 'Is a standing desk worth it for remote work?',
    answer: '<p>Yes, standing desks are worth the investment for remote workers. Studies show that alternating between sitting and standing can reduce back pain, improve energy levels, and boost productivity. If you work from home 8+ hours daily, a standing desk helps break up sedentary time.</p><p>The key is variety—standing all day isn\'t better than sitting all day. The best approach is switching positions every 30-60 minutes. A quality standing desk makes this effortless with one-touch preset buttons.</p>'
