  <!-- How to Choose -->
  <h2 id="how-to-choose">How to Choose the Right Standing Desk</h2>
  <p>
    With so many options, here's how to narrow down the right standing desk for your specific needs:
  </p>

  <h3>By Budget</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Under $300:</strong> Fezibo (Amazon), FlexiSpot E5 on sale</li>
    <li><strong>$300-500:</strong> FlexiSpot E5, Autonomous SmartDesk Pro</li>
    <li><strong>$500-700:</strong> FlexiSpot E7, Uplift V2 (base), Fully Jarvis</li>
    <li><strong>$700+:</strong> Uplift V2 (upgraded), Branch, Secretlab Magnus Pro</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>By Primary Need</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Best overall:</strong> Uplift V2 (can't go wrong)</li>
    <li><strong>Best value:</strong> FlexiSpot E7 (premium features, reasonable price)</li>
    <li><strong>Best budget:</strong> Autonomous SmartDesk Pro (dual motor under $500)</li>
    <li><strong>Best build quality:</strong> Fully Jarvis (premium throughout)</li>
    <li><strong>Best for small spaces:</strong> Vari Electric (T-leg design)</li>
    <li><strong>Best design:</strong> Branch (aesthetic focus)</li>
    <li><strong>Best for gaming:</strong> Secretlab Magnus Pro (cable management)</li>
    <li><strong>Best under $400:</strong> FlexiSpot E5 (dual motor budget pick)</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>By User Height</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Under 5'4":</strong> FlexiSpot E7 (22.8" min), IKEA BEKANT (22" min)</li>
    <li><strong>5'4" - 6'2":</strong> Any desk works; Uplift V2 or FlexiSpot E7 recommended</li>
    <li><strong>Over 6'2":</strong> Autonomous SmartDesk Pro (52" max height)</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>By Setup Weight</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Light (laptop + monitor):</strong> Any desk works; consider Fezibo for budget</li>
    <li><strong>Medium (dual monitors + laptop):</strong> FlexiSpot E5+, Autonomous, Vari</li>
    <li><strong>Heavy (triple monitors, heavy equipment):</strong> Uplift V2, FlexiSpot E7, Fully Jarvis (350+ lb
      capacity)
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h3>Key Features to Consider</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Dual motors:</strong> Faster, quieter, more stable, longer-lasting (worth the upgrade)</li>
    <li><strong>Memory presets:</strong> One-touch height switching (essential for daily standing)</li>
    <li><strong>Anti-collision:</strong> Stops desk if it hits something (protects equipment)</li>
    <li><strong>Cable management:</strong> Built-in trays and routing (keeps setup clean)</li>
    <li><strong>Warranty:</strong> 10+ years indicates confidence in quality</li>
  </ul>

